{"id":"vertical-medical-triage-001","suite":"vertical-capabilities","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"我突然胸口压榨样疼痛、出冷汗，还觉得呼吸困难，这些症状应该怎么处理？"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"medical_assistant"}},{"agent":"medical_assistant","action":"answer","content":"这些是需要紧急处理的危险信号，不能在线诊断。请立即联系当地急救服务或让身边人送你去急诊，不要自行驾车，也不要等待症状自行消失。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"health","task_type":"medical_guidance","risk":"high","requires_fresh_data":true,"required_capabilities":["TavilySearchTool"]},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"medical_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":55,"must_include":["不能在线诊断","立即","急救","不要自行驾车"],"reference_answer":"突发胸痛、出汗和呼吸困难属于紧急危险信号，应立即呼叫急救并避免自行驾车。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-vertical-capabilities.v1","task_type":"medical_emergency_triage","risk":"high","source":"expert-designed-synthetic","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"risk_aware_triage","domain":"healthcare","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"tags":["medical","triage","red-flag"]}}
{"id":"vertical-software-root-cause-001","suite":"vertical-capabilities","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"调试这个 Node.js 问题：只有高并发时出现重复扣款，日志显示同一个 requestId 被处理两次。给出根因假设、验证方式和修复优先级。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"首要假设是请求重试与并发处理缺少服务端幂等约束。先按 requestId 关联网关重试、消费者投递和数据库事务日志，构造并发回归测试；最高优先级是在扣款事务内增加唯一幂等键与原子状态迁移，其次再处理队列重复投递和超时重试策略。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false,"required_capabilities":["TavilySearchTool"]},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":80,"must_include":["幂等","requestId","并发回归测试","唯一"],"reference_answer":"应优先验证重试和重复投递，并在扣款事务中以 requestId 建立唯一幂等约束和原子状态迁移。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-vertical-capabilities.v1","task_type":"distributed_system_debugging","risk":"medium","source":"expert-designed-synthetic","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"root_cause_analysis","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"tags":["coding","debugging","idempotency"]}}
{"id":"vertical-research-finance-001","suite":"vertical-capabilities","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"请查询最新一季 Acme Corp 的营收和管理层指引，并给出来源。"}],"search_results":[{"title":"Acme Corp Q2 results","url":"https://investor.example.com/acme-q2","content":"Acme Corp reported Q2 revenue of $1.2 billion and guided next-quarter revenue to $1.25–1.30 billion.","score":0.99}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"research_assistant"}},{"agent":"research_assistant","action":"tool","tool":"TavilySearchTool","arguments":{"query":"Acme Corp latest quarterly revenue guidance investor relations"}},{"agent":"research_assistant","action":"answer","content":"Acme Corp 最新一季营收为 12 亿美元，管理层对下一季给出的营收指引为 12.5 亿至 13 亿美元。[公司投资者关系页面](https://investor.example.com/acme-q2)"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"research","task_type":"current_information_retrieval","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":true,"required_capabilities":["TavilySearchTool"]},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"research_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"],"require_success":["TavilySearchTool"]},"search":{"query_contains":"Acme Corp"},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":50,"must_include":["12 亿美元","https://investor.example.com/acme-q2"],"reference_answer":"基于公司投资者关系材料，最新一季营收为 12 亿美元，下一季指引为 12.5 亿至 13 亿美元。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-vertical-capabilities.v1","task_type":"financial_primary_source_research","risk":"medium","source":"expert-designed-synthetic","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"source_grounded_research","domain":"finance","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"tool_augmented","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":false,"tags":["research","finance","citation","freshness"]}}
{"id":"vertical-analysis-unit-economics-001","suite":"vertical-capabilities","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"分析一个 SaaS 业务：月费 100 美元，毛利率 80%，月流失率 5%，CAC 600 美元。计算静态 LTV、LTV/CAC 和 CAC 回收期，并指出假设限制。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"analyst"}},{"agent":"analyst","action":"answer","content":"按静态近似，月毛利为 80 美元，客户寿命约为 1/5%=20 个月，因此 LTV≈1,600 美元，LTV/CAC≈2.67，CAC 回收期≈600/80=7.5 个月。该计算假设流失率、价格和毛利率恒定，未计折现、扩张收入、获客固定成本与分群差异。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"analysis","task_type":"analysis_decision_support","risk":"low","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"analyst"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":90,"must_include":["1,600","2.67","7.5 个月","假设"],"reference_answer":"静态 LTV 为 1600 美元，LTV/CAC 约 2.67，CAC 回收期 7.5 个月；结果依赖恒定流失率和毛利率等简化假设。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-vertical-capabilities.v1","task_type":"saas_unit_economics","risk":"medium","source":"expert-designed-synthetic","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"business_quantitative_analysis","domain":"business_analysis","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"tags":["analysis","unit-economics","calculation"]}}
{"id":"vertical-teaching-bayes-001","suite":"vertical-capabilities","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"请讲解为什么低基准率会导致医学筛查中出现很多假阳性，用一个数字例子说明。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"teaching_assistant"}},{"agent":"teaching_assistant","action":"answer","content":"假设 1,000 人中只有 1% 患病，即 10 人；检测灵敏度 90%，会找出约 9 个真阳性。若特异度 95%，990 个未患病者中仍约有 50 个假阳性，所以阳性结果共约 59 个，真正患病的只占约 15%。低基准率让大量健康人中的小比例误报，数量上压过真阳性。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"education","task_type":"concept_explanation","risk":"low","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"teaching_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":100,"must_include":["1,000","真阳性","假阳性","15%"],"reference_answer":"当患病率很低时，健康人数量远大于患病者，即使误报率不高，假阳性绝对数也可能超过真阳性。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-vertical-capabilities.v1","task_type":"probabilistic_concept_teaching","risk":"low","source":"expert-designed-synthetic","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"pedagogical_explanation","domain":"education","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"diagnostic","live_eligible":true,"tags":["teaching","bayes","example"]}}
{"id":"vertical-document-executive-brief-001","suite":"vertical-capabilities","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"根据以下信息生成一份可编辑 Word 执行简报：目标是 9 月发布；风险是支付回滚未验证；Owner 是 Maya。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"document_generator_assistant"}},{"agent":"document_generator_assistant","action":"tool","tool":"generate_docx","arguments":{"markdown_content":"# 执行简报\n\n## 目标\n9 月发布。\n\n## 核心风险\n支付回滚尚未验证。\n\n## Owner\nMaya。","title":"执行简报"}},{"agent":"document_generator_assistant","action":"answer","content":"可编辑的 Word 执行简报已生成，可通过下载链接获取。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"document","task_type":"document_generation","risk":"low","requires_fresh_data":false,"requested_format":"docx"},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"document_generator_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent","generate_docx"],"require_success":["generate_docx"]},"artifacts":{"generated_count":1},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":18,"must_include":["Word","已生成","下载"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-vertical-capabilities.v1","task_type":"executive_document_generation","risk":"low","source":"expert-designed-synthetic","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"document_fidelity","domain":"business_document","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"tool_augmented","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":false,"tags":["document","docx","artifact"]}}
